1
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,960
♪You are a devil.♪

2
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:47,520
♪But you are my medicine.♪

3
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:06,240
Hello.

4
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:07,800
Are you at home?

5
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,520
We've been neighbors for so long,

6
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:21,880
this is my first time visiting your house.

7
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:23,440
Ah.

8
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:27,200
Wow,

9
00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:40,200
I don't even have this photo.

10
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:42,040
You were so young back then.

11
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:47,640
Yeah.

12
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:49,680
This telescope can really see my house.

13
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:00,400
It's quite clear.

14
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:02,840
Maybe I should put one up at my place too.

15
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:03,880
Then I can see you.

16
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:05,680
It's only fair, right?

17
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:07,360
Is that why you're here?

18
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,520
Yeah.

19
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,400
Have you had breakfast yet?

20
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,160
Huh?

21
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:21,960
The noodles you made for me last time were really good.

22
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,480
This time, let me cook for you.

23
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:33,880
Have a try.

24
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:52,720
Have you made up your mind?

25
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,280
Yes.

26
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,080
Some things

27
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,240
must be put to an end.

28
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,240
Can you really face her?

29
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,600
After all, she's your mom.

30
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:19,320
I used to

31
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:22,200
live in the world she created for me,

32
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,760
thinking power and status,

33
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:27,720
being the Lin family's heir was everything.

34
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,800
But when I met you,

35
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:34,200
and learned the truth, I realized

36
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:37,800
how ridiculous my life had been.

37
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:39,880
Don't you hate me?

38
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:42,520
I dragged you into this mess.

39
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:43,600
I did hate you,

40
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:45,520
for showing up,

41
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:46,360
for exposing the truth,

42
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:48,080
for making me lose everything.

43
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:51,080
But now,

44
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:53,880
I'm grateful to you.

45
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:57,520
You made me see myself clearly.

46
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,440
Xintian,

47
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,280
I'm not doing this for you,

48
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,280
I'm doing it for myself.

49
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,680
I'll take her to turn herself in.

50
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:10,680
As for our issues,

51
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,560
we'll deal with them after this is all over.

52
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:14,800
But now,

53
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:19,240
we're on the same side,

54
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:21,920
right?

55
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:32,560
Yeah.

56
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:38,800
The noodles are getting cold.

57
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:39,880
Eat up.

58
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,680
Lawyer Guan,

59
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:03,360
I'm the police officer in charge of Su Wei's case.

60
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,480
Su Wei had a sudden allergic shock yesterday.

61
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:06,680
After emergency treatment,

62
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:08,120
she is now out of danger.

63
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,720
She asked me to tell you that

64
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:12,320
She will cooperate in exposing those involved.

65
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,680
After our investigation,

66
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:14,600
the allergenic drug

67
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:17,240
was smeared on the clothes brought by the family in advance.

68
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,640
The family also confirmed that

69
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:20,760
Clothes came from a self-proclaimed friend of hers.

70
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,360
It's all been cleaned up.

71
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,360
All the necessary

72
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,080
connections have been made.

73
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:32,840
But the police is very strict.

74
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:35,240
If Su Wei speaks, we...

75
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,360
What a bunch of losers!

76
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:38,120
You can't even handle this.

77
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:39,960
Go to Xu Tianyou.

78
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,920
We need to hide for a while.

79
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,200
He knows what to do.

80
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,080
Mr. Lin,

81
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:02,280
you're back.

82
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:04,000
Still calling me Mr. Lin?

83
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,800
In my heart,

84
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,000
you'll always be Mr. Lin.

85
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:13,400
Really?

86
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:16,000
Then in your heart,

87
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:18,440
what am I to you?

88
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:21,760
I...

89
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:23,560
I...

90
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:24,760
I'm your driver.

91
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,000
A driver?

92
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:26,680
Ah,

93
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:28,440
or

94
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:33,040
my biological father?

95
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:50,480
Do you know how many people you've harmed?

96
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,840
Do you know how many bad things you've done?

97
00:07:57,640 --> 00:07:58,440
Killing Wang Jiming,

98
00:07:58,440 --> 00:07:59,120
harming Gu Qingyu,

99
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,560
and now trying to kill Guan Tiantian.

100
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:02,280
Your hands are just as bloody

101
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:03,360
as hers.

102
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:07,160
I didn't mean to.

103
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:08,920
I was forced to do it.

104
00:08:09,400 --> 00:08:10,240
She promised me

105
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:11,760
you would have a good life.

106
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,600
You would be the heir to the Lin Group.

107
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:14,840
I...

108
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,200
I did it for your sake.

109
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,880
So you sold me out.

110
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:24,200
You traded your son's life

111
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:27,320
for your stable position as the driver, right?

112
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:29,440
No.

113
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:31,600
It's not like that, Jiming.

114
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:32,680
I...

115
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:34,240
I'm sorry.

116
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:36,080
I have no choice.

117
00:08:36,680 --> 00:08:37,080
She...

118
00:08:37,560 --> 00:08:39,240
She controls everything.

119
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:40,960
I...

120
00:08:41,280 --> 00:08:43,880
I don't even have the courage to acknowledge you.

121
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:51,960
What's the point of saying this now?

122
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:52,920
Jiming.

123
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:55,280
Jiming.

124
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:05,040
Poisoning your husband,

125
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:07,400
stealing his identity,

126
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,480
and murdering your stepson.

127
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,120
Wen Shiyi,

128
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:20,280
how can you deny this?

129
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:32,280
Where did you get

130
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:33,840
all these forged documents?

131
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,080
What do you want?

132
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:36,920
You want to accuse your mother

133
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:39,920
with these?

134
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,680
You're not my mother.

135
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:51,360
You're the devil.

136
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:55,240
If I'm not your mother,

137
00:09:56,760 --> 00:09:58,080
who raised you

138
00:09:58,520 --> 00:10:00,040
for the past thirty years?

139
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:03,040
Who taught you to walk and talk?

140
00:10:03,920 --> 00:10:04,640
Who

141
00:10:04,880 --> 00:10:06,200
stayed up all night

142
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:08,200
when you were sick?

143
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:08,880
Who

144
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,360
gave you the best education,

145
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:12,680
and made you the Lin heir?

146
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:14,880
If I'm not your mother,

147
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,440
then who am I?

148
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:17,200
Ah.

149
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,640
What you say today is useless.

150
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,680
I will take you to turn yourself in.
